写法 谁画 适用 <code>{"parent": "minecraft:item/generated"}</code> 等普通 JSON 原版 baked 模型 图标是 2D 贴图 <code>{"parent": "minecraft:builtin/entity"}</code> 本项目 BEWLR 图标/手持/地面用本项目模型 <pre><code>// assets/&lt;ns&gt;/models/item/&lt;item_path&gt;.json
{"parent": "minecraft:builtin/entity"}
</code></pre> <p><code>builtin/entity</code> 会被烘成 <code>BuiltInModel</code>（<code>isCustomRenderer() == true</code>），<code>ItemRenderer</code> 于是不画 quad，改调 <code>renderByItem</code>。没有注册对应物品的 BEWLR 时，物品会完全不可见 —— 这是最常见的"写对了却看不见"。</p>

类型 完整包名 用途 <code>Skeleton</code>, <code>SkeletonDynamics</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.structure.skeleton</code> 骨骼和共享动力学定义 <code>SkeletonDynamics.*</code> 同上，<code>SkeletonDynamics</code> 的嵌套类型 物理、IK 和闭环数据 <code>SkeletonDynamicsBuilder</code>, <code>SkeletonDynamicsReader&lt;T&gt;</code>, <code>SkeletonBuilder</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.loaders</code> 构建、校验和外部格式扩展 <code>SkeletonInstance</code>, <code>ModelInstance</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.dynamic</code> 每实例控制和姿态求值 <code>CalikoIkSolver</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.dynamic.ik</code> 求解适配与诊断结果 <code>IkTargetModule</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.dynamic.tick_loop.handler</code> 每 tick 外部 IK 目标 <code>MmdSkeletonDynamicsReader</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.typo.miku_miku_dance</code> PMX/已转换 PMD 数据转换 <code>GltfSkeletonDynamicsReader</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.typo.gltf</code> glTF 节点物理候选转换 <p>本页代码块除独立声明外使用以下 imports；<code>model</code> 表示已经加载的 <code>Model</code>：</p> <pre><code>import lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.dynamic.ModelInstance;
import lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.loaders.SkeletonDynamicsBuilder;
import lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.loaders.SkeletonDynamicsReader;
import lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.structure.skeleton.Skeleton;
import lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.structure.skeleton.SkeletonDynamics;
import lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.structure.skeleton.SkeletonDynamics.*;
import org.joml.Vector3f;
import java.util.List;
</code></pre>

工厂类与模块 注册的 <code>type</code> 能力与契约 <code>DataDrivenBlockFactory</code>（<code>modules/data-driven</code>） 方块 <code>"data_driven_block"</code> 实现 <code>StatefulBlockFactory</code>（<code>createsBlockItem=true</code>），构建支持 <code>state_properties</code> 的 <code>DataDrivenBlock</code>；由 <code>JsonTreeBuilder.ensureHandlersRegistered()</code> 或显式调用 <code>DataDrivenBlockFactory.registerIfAbsent()</code> 注册 <code>FsmBlockEntityFactories</code>（<code>modules/modelling</code>） 方块 <code>"fsm_block"</code>（<code>createsBlockItem=true</code>）；BE <code>"fsm_be"</code> <code>fsm_block</code> 绑定 <code>FsmBlock</code>（非 stateful）；<code>fsm_be</code> 绑定 <code>AnimationBlockEntity</code>，从 <code>params</code> 读取 <code>state_machine</code> / <code>model</code> / <code>model_name</code>。需显式触发类加载或调用 <code>FsmBlockEntityFactories.registerBuiltin()</code> <code>ProxyModelBlockFactories</code>（<code>modules/modelling</code>） 方块 <code>"proxy_model"</code>（<code>BLOCK_TYPE</code>，<code>StatefulBlockFactory</code>，<code>createsBlockItem=true</code>）；BE <code>"proxy_model_be"</code>（<code>BLOCK_ENTITY_TYPE</code>） <code>@Context</code> bean，在 <code>@PostConstruct init()</code> 自动调用幂等的 <code>registerBuiltin()</code> <p><code>ProxyModelBlockFactories</code>（<code>modules/modelling/.../proxies/ProxyModelBlockFactories.java:39-403</code>）关键契约与扩展接口：</p> <ul> <li><code>proxy_model</code> 方块主机：<code>ProxyModelBlock</code> 实现 <code>EntityBlock</code>，通过 <code>StatePropertyContext</code> 自动挂载 <code>state_properties</code>，在 <code>onBlockStateChange</code> 转发 <code>StateProperty.notifyChanges(level, pos, oldState, newState)</code>，为水平 <code>facing</code> 与 <code>hinge</code> 提供原版放置/旋转/镜像行为，并以 <code>RenderShape.ENTITYBLOCK_ANIMATED</code>（实体渲染形态）避免烘培模型缺失时泄漏紫黑格贴图。若 JSON 方块条目带有非空 <code>params</code>，<code>validateBlockParams(params)</code> 会立即抛 <code>IllegalArgumentException</code>。</li> <li><code>proxy_model_be</code> 模型解析公开入口：   <pre><code>public record ModelSettings(
        ProxyModelSelection selection,
        float yawOffset,
        Map&lt;String, Float&gt; facingYaw,
        @Nullable ModelLightingMode lightingMode
)
public static ModelSettings parseModelSettings(@Nullable JsonObject params)  // :131
</code></pre> <code>parseModelSettings</code> 支持消费方在自定义代理宿主中复用与 <code>proxy_model_be</code> 完全一致的 <code>params</code> 解析逻辑（<code>model</code>、<code>model_name</code>、<code>default_model</code>、<code>yaw_offset</code>、<code>facing_yaw</code>、<code>lighting_mode</code>、<code>model_groups</code>、<code>model_by_state</code>；若出现已移除的 <code>params.animation</code> 则直接抛 <code>IllegalArgumentException</code>）。JSON 字段细节见 schema.md。</li> <li>Java 动画与状态控制扩展点：消费 mod 不应在 JSON <code>proxy_model</code> 中声明交互或播放逻辑，而应继承 <code>ProxyModelBlock</code> 并覆写：   <pre><code>public ProxyComposition&lt;ProxyModelBlockEntity, ProxyModelInput, Void, Void, Void&gt;
createProxyComposition(ProxyModelBlockEntity element)
</code></pre>   同时将自定义 <code>StatefulBlockFactory</code> 注册为自有 <code>type</code>（可借助 <code>ProxyModelBlockEntity</code> 与 <code>ProxyModelProxy.builder(element)</code> 定制状态机、播控与局部动作）。</li> </ul>

Form Drawn by Use <code>{"parent": "minecraft:item/generated"}</code> etc. Vanilla baked model a 2D icon <code>{"parent": "minecraft:builtin/entity"}</code> this project's BEWLR GUI, hand and ground using the project model <pre><code>// assets/&lt;ns&gt;/models/item/&lt;item_path&gt;.json
{"parent": "minecraft:builtin/entity"}
</code></pre> <p><code>builtin/entity</code> bakes into <code>BuiltInModel</code> (<code>isCustomRenderer() == true</code>), so <code>ItemRenderer</code> skips quads and calls <code>renderByItem</code>. Without a registered BEWLR for that item, the item is completely invisible — the most common "I wrote it correctly but see nothing" case.</p>

Type Full package name Purpose <code>Skeleton</code>, <code>SkeletonDynamics</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.structure.skeleton</code> Bones and shared dynamics definitions <code>SkeletonDynamics.*</code> same as above; nested types of <code>SkeletonDynamics</code> Physics, IK, and closure data <code>SkeletonDynamicsBuilder</code>, <code>SkeletonDynamicsReader&lt;T&gt;</code>, <code>SkeletonBuilder</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.loaders</code> Construction, validation, and external format extension <code>SkeletonInstance</code>, <code>ModelInstance</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.dynamic</code> Per-instance control and pose evaluation <code>CalikoIkSolver</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.dynamic.ik</code> Solver adaptation and diagnostic results <code>IkTargetModule</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.dynamic.tick_loop.handler</code> Per-tick external IK targets <code>MmdSkeletonDynamicsReader</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.typo.miku_miku_dance</code> PMX/converted PMD data conversion <code>GltfSkeletonDynamicsReader</code> <code>lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.typo.gltf</code> glTF node physics candidate conversion <p>Unless declared standalone, the code blocks on this page use the following imports; <code>model</code> denotes an already loaded <code>Model</code>:</p> <pre><code>import lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.dynamic.ModelInstance;
import lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.loaders.SkeletonDynamicsBuilder;
import lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.loaders.SkeletonDynamicsReader;
import lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.structure.skeleton.Skeleton;
import lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.structure.skeleton.SkeletonDynamics;
import lib.kasuga.rendering.models.uml.structure.skeleton.SkeletonDynamics.*;
import org.joml.Vector3f;
import java.util.List;
</code></pre>

Class and module Registered <code>type</code> keys Contract <code>DataDrivenBlockFactory</code> (<code>modules/data-driven</code>) Block <code>"data_driven_block"</code> <code>StatefulBlockFactory</code> with <code>createsBlockItem=true</code>, creating <code>DataDrivenBlock</code>; registered by <code>JsonTreeBuilder.ensureHandlersRegistered()</code> or <code>DataDrivenBlockFactory.registerIfAbsent()</code> <code>FsmBlockEntityFactories</code> (<code>modules/modelling</code>) Block <code>"fsm_block"</code> (<code>createsBlockItem=true</code>); BE <code>"fsm_be"</code> <code>fsm_block</code> → <code>FsmBlock</code>; <code>fsm_be</code> → <code>AnimationBlockEntity</code> reading <code>state_machine</code>, <code>model</code>, <code>model_name</code> from <code>params</code>; registered on class load or via <code>registerBuiltin()</code> <code>ProxyModelBlockFactories</code> (<code>modules/modelling</code>) Block <code>"proxy_model"</code> (<code>BLOCK_TYPE</code>, <code>StatefulBlockFactory</code>, <code>createsBlockItem=true</code>); BE <code>"proxy_model_be"</code> (<code>BLOCK_ENTITY_TYPE</code>) Micronaut <code>@Context</code> bean calling idempotent <code>registerBuiltin()</code> from <code>@PostConstruct init()</code> <p>Key contracts of <code>ProxyModelBlockFactories</code> (<code>modules/modelling/.../proxies/ProxyModelBlockFactories.java:39-403</code>):</p> <ul> <li><code>proxy_model</code> block host: <code>ProxyModelBlock</code> implements <code>EntityBlock</code>, installs <code>state_properties</code> via <code>StatePropertyContext</code>, forwards <code>StateProperty.notifyChanges(level, pos, oldState, newState)</code> in <code>onBlockStateChange</code>, wires horizontal <code>facing</code> and <code>hinge</code> placement/rotation/mirroring, and uses <code>RenderShape.ENTITYBLOCK_ANIMATED</code> so missing baked JSON block models never leak purple/black fallback cubes. Passing non-empty <code>params</code> on the block throws <code>IllegalArgumentException</code> in <code>validateBlockParams</code>.</li> <li>Public <code>proxy_model_be</code> parser:   <pre><code>public record ModelSettings(
        ProxyModelSelection selection,
        float yawOffset,
        Map&lt;String, Float&gt; facingYaw,
        @Nullable ModelLightingMode lightingMode
)
public static ModelSettings parseModelSettings(@Nullable JsonObject params)  // :131
</code></pre>   Consuming mods can call <code>parseModelSettings</code> to reuse the exact <code>model</code>, <code>model_name</code>, <code>default_model</code>, <code>yaw_offset</code>, <code>facing_yaw</code>, <code>lighting_mode</code>, <code>model_groups</code>, and <code>model_by_state</code> parser (passing <code>params.animation</code> throws <code>IllegalArgumentException</code>). See schema.md for the JSON schema.</li> <li>Java extension seam for animation and interaction: content-specific controllers belong in Java rather than JSON — subclass <code>ProxyModelBlock</code> and override:   <pre><code>public ProxyComposition&lt;ProxyModelBlockEntity, ProxyModelInput, Void, Void, Void&gt;
createProxyComposition(ProxyModelBlockEntity element)
</code></pre>   and register a custom <code>StatefulBlockFactory</code> using <code>ProxyModelBlockEntity</code> / <code>ProxyModelProxy.builder(element)</code>.</li> </ul>
